  "interpretation": "<h3 data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"591\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"589\">Clinical Use:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"670\">\n<p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"670\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\">Detection of <strong data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"641\">growth hormone-producing cells</strong> in <strong data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"667\">pituitary adenomas</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"750\">\n<p data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"750\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\">Helps classify <strong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"708\">pituitary tumors</strong>, especially in acromegaly or gigantism.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"829\">\n<p data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"829\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\">Used in differential diagnosis of <strong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"828\">hypothalamic-pituitary axis disorders</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
